Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.05,0:00:21.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宇宙海盗哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.85,0:01:34.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老样子 又要继续旅行了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.09,0:01:40.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然是自己选的路
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.57,0:01:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是希望偶尔有美女包围我这样的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.41,0:01:48.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.07,0:01:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饭准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.56,0:01:52.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算送来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.97,0:01:53.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整天无聊的要命
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.91,0:01:56.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃饭是我现在最大的享受了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.25,0:01:57.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请用！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.29,0:02:03.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞蒂 又是营养套餐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.81,0:02:04.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类真是可怜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.83,0:02:07.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦放松机能就会变得迟钝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.97,0:02:09.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.25,0:02:14.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我想要在酒池肉林和美女游玩变成呆子的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.17,0:02:23.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.19,0:02:25.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放烟花吗？还真华丽
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.77,0:02:29.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是慧星吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.33,0:02:36.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真有情调
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.05,0:02:38.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慧星在玩捉迷藏吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.17,0:02:46.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冲过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.47,0:02:59.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第十四话 魔王加鲁丹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.17,0:03:15.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.57,0:03:18.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎参加我的晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.37,0:03:20.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你 让我躲起来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.61,0:03:23.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个邪恶的男人在追我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.61,0:03:25.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邪恶的男人？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.33,0:03:28.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留在这里！包你安心啦 可爱小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.37,0:03:32.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.23,0:03:32.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.57,0:03:43.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个家伙还真够大啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.25,0:03:48.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比拉美，我知道你躲在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.05,0:03:49.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.59,0:03:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.53,0:03:54.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁要回去你身边
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.53,0:03:59.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我选的话 我比较喜欢这个人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.61,0:04:02.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想惹我生气吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.57,0:04:06.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大叔 你被讨厌了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.21,0:04:08.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大叔？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.65,0:04:12.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是够缠人的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.85,0:04:14.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快滚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.23,0:04:15.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然要你吃点苦头
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.25,0:04:18.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫我吃苦头？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.17,0:04:22.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满口大话的小鬼头
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.05,0:04:23.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.75,0:04:24.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你试看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.01,0:04:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶你这个大头鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.01,0:04:29.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待会你可别哭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.13,0:04:31.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用电磁护壁教训你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.69,0:04:38.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.67,0:04:39.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.29,0:04:46.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.61,0:04:53.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要！放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.23,0:04:55.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样嘛 和我一起回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.25,0:04:57.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞蒂！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.45,0:05:00.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你少来了，大头鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.41,0:05:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问也不问屋主 就擅自跑进来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.35,0:05:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不想被揍就快滚！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.05,0:05:12.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛？叫我离开！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.77,0:05:13.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.01,0:05:19.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道痛了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.73,0:05:22.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是令人惊讶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.69,0:05:26.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头一次有人能打倒我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.13,0:05:29.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也第一次有人反抗我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.53,0:05:32.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小子！我要把你撕成两半！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.73,0:06:00.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞蒂，顺便为这位客人准备份晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.71,0:06:01.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.25,0:06:09.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蛮有一手的！小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.77,0:06:10.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很中意你！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.93,0:06:14.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在找这种有骨气的年轻人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.37,0:06:18.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你做我的仆人！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.41,0:06:19.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.37,0:06:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.37,0:07:27.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.17,0:07:30.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么偏偏被我遇见这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.65,0:07:32.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.21,0:07:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.21,0:07:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被发现就不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.89,0:07:45.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是叫比拉美吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.69,0:07:47.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是什么地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.05,0:07:51.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大魔王加鲁丹的宇宙船
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.41,0:07:52.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大魔王加鲁丹
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.01,0:07:55.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个大头鬼吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.13,0:07:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.89,0:07:57.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加鲁丹是个可怕的魔法师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.01,0:07:59.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,魔法？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.61,0:08:00.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.37,0:08:02.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也从加鲁丹那里学得一点魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.13,0:08:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本想利用这力量从逃出这里…可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.93,0:08:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被抓了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.57,0:08:12.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 为了我害你遇上这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.05,0:08:15.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里！这不是你的错
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.89,0:08:18.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管这些了，你快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.53,0:08:20.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加鲁丹想要你做他的仆人！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.05,0:08:24.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样欢迎未来的仆人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.77,0:08:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你继续留在这里的话，就被他用魔法控制住了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.45,0:08:30.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算要我逃跑的话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.93,0:08:31.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的拍档瑞蒂和船
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.97,0:08:36.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的船和机械人都平安无事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.37,0:08:38.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们被冻结在时之房
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.41,0:08:39.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冻结？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.77,0:08:42.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用魔法来停止住时间的流动
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.73,0:08:44.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放着不管的话，他们就会变成石头
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.89,0:08:46.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,石头？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.95,0:08:48.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,石头啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.77,0:08:50.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之你先带我到那里去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.69,0:09:46.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太令人吃惊了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.37,0:09:52.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些财宝是魔王加鲁丹从各个星球的人手中抢来的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.37,0:09:54.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样子啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.17,0:09:55.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.93,0:09:57.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,适合我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.25,0:10:03.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是这宝石 加鲁丹靠他可以自由伸缩的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.05,0:10:04.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和魔法的力量 夺取各星球的女人与人类
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.13,0:10:09.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才逼着要我当他的仆人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.97,0:10:25.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 打扰你们！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.89,0:10:43.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这么点本事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.43,0:10:44.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉，这边！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.69,0:10:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.69,0:10:57.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你了 飞稳一点要不然我会晕的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.93,0:11:02.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法 我只会一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.69,0:11:04.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么无证驾驶！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.97,0:11:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪开闪开闪开！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.79,0:11:33.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们吵什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.39,0:11:41.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然又是你啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.07,0:11:47.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来地方看来不怎么妙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.83,0:11:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.95,0:12:03.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要和这个男人说两句
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.51,0:12:06.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.71,0:12:08.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫哥普拉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.39,0:12:10.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎样 喜欢这艘船吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.95,0:12:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是泰拉斯星的国王也没有机会住这么美丽的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.11,0:12:19.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美女要多少就有多少
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.95,0:12:22.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢？你想说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.67,0:12:27.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在寻找你这种勇敢的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.51,0:12:28.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多谢你看得起我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.03,0:12:34.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样要不要和我一起去进攻各个星球
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.07,0:12:39.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,金银珠宝和大把的软妹子，想要多少有多少
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.07,0:12:45.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我说不呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.83,0:12:51.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想惹我生气吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.27,0:12:53.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉 我拒绝！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.51,0:12:55.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌受人驱使
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.43,0:12:59.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你还没有明白
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.47,0:13:02.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是请求 是命令！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.83,0:13:04.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.43,0:13:06.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我也不留情了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.75,0:13:12.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.47,0:13:16.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才你吞下的是气球种子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:18.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,气球种子？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.83,0:13:20.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.95,0:13:59.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的每个人都吞下过气球种子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.67,0:14:03.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以没有人敢反抗我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.71,0:14:06.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌 别用那种眼光看我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.35,0:14:07.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是开玩笑吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.83,0:14:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不，不要，不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.27,0:14:19.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.55,0:14:21.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎样？要当我的仆人了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.83,0:14:24.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死也不当你的仆人！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.67,0:14:26.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶的哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.67,0:14:34.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.43,0:14:35.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把嘴巴张开！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.99,0:14:46.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我替你来拿出气球种子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.35,0:14:48.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.15,0:14:50.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可原谅！比拉美！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.23,0:14:55.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿出来了 放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.83,0:14:58.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你居然敢忤逆我的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:15:01.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个不听话的小家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.43,0:15:04.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也要把你变成气球然后撑爆它
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.43,0:15:07.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.23,0:15:18.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.67,0:15:20.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你居然也会那个魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.99,0:15:22.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是加鲁丹教我的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.83,0:15:24.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 趁现在逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.63,0:15:33.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭娘们 竟敢戏弄我！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.59,0:15:37.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可原谅！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.49,0:15:39.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要把你们大卸八块
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.75,0:15:57.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是时之房
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.61,0:15:59.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的船和同伴被冻结在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.87,0:16:11.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪 明明没有人却感觉有很多眼光注视我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.59,0:16:28.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在动！你看！石像在动！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.23,0:16:31.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是普通的石像！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.63,0:16:35.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是被加鲁丹用魔法变成石像的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.23,0:16:54.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是人偶啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.91,0:16:56.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吓了我一跳！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.67,0:17:08.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…我的船！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.91,0:17:16.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的变成石头了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.35,0:17:18.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞蒂！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.19,0:17:20.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞蒂！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.19,0:17:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比拉美！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.31,0:17:28.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是魔法方面的专家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.63,0:17:30.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能不能想想办法吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.03,0:17:33.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用魔法或咒文…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.95,0:17:36.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要不打倒加鲁丹，魔法就没有办法解除
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.71,0:17:38.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是那个家伙是个怪物啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.67,0:17:40.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一个方法
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.95,0:17:43.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,房间的某处藏有骷髅头
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.79,0:17:45.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骷髅头？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.11,0:17:48.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要射穿那个骷髅头的眉间
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.59,0:17:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,眉间？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.89,0:17:50.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.71,0:17:54.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是加鲁丹作梦时自己说的，他唯一的弱点
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.11,0:17:59.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这个房间里德骷髅头？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.43,0:18:14.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里都没看到骷髅头！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.19,0:18:18.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来找过好几次也没找到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.55,0:18:21.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加鲁丹的梦话可信吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.75,0:18:24.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然 一定藏在某处
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.43,0:18:29.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比拉美！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.15,0:18:29.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你退后！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.55,0:18:32.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.71,0:18:35.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可没叫你来！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.87,0:18:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.91,0:18:44.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要试几次才能死心啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.31,0:18:45.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.55,0:18:47.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最少装个疼痛的样子吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.55,0:19:38.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.03,0:19:47.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样？知道我的厉害了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.27,0:19:49.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.03,0:19:49.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.95,0:19:52.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再给你一次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.03,0:19:55.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愿不愿意做我的仆人？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.19,0:19:58.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也真够缠人的！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.35,0:20:00.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像是难对付的汽车推销员
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.31,0:20:07.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就死吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.39,0:20:19.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那里！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.55,0:20:57.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想不到…这就是大魔王的弱点
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.43,0:21:00.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命！放我出去！求求你！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.91,0:21:02.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉 哥普拉先生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.03,0:21:05.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.05,0:21:07.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么我都愿意做！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.07,0:21:10.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要丢弃我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.15,0:21:12.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我出去！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.31,0:21:17.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经在这里被封印了三千年了，好不容易出来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.87,0:21:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个贪心的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.03,0:21:23.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里面再呆个三千年吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.15,0:21:24.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看，哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.63,0:21:31.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,魔法解除了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.75,0:21:39.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可爱的美女！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.39,0:21:44.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.51,0:21:46.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞蒂！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.19,0:21:51.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们要我来做国王
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.31,0:21:53.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是接受吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.03,0:22:09.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被美女包围的桃源乡又消失在梦中了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.59,0:22:11.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.95,0:22:13.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么好可惜的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.83,0:22:15.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.23,0:22:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正海盗哥普拉的命运就是如此了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.27,0:22:21.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧，瑞蒂！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.97,0:22:22.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.71,0:22:34.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从远方星星来 ，到远方的星星去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.35,0:22:37.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救救我！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.96,0:22:46.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,8年前因格星的贝根救过我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.47,0:22:48.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是现在他变成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.70,0:22:51.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有一点希望我都投入极大的热情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.30,0:22:52.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因格星的标志物龙水晶
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.81,0:22:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要把它从基尔顿那里抢回来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.54,0:22:56.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要给予帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.94,0:22:59.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又遇上麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.38,0:23:01.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遇到了巨大的龙
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.05,0:23:04.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一集\N龙水晶的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.15,0:23:06.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见面吧
